# Implementation Plan - Admin Management Links on Store Pages

This plan outlines the steps to replace the "Open Import Tool" links on the public-facing store pages with direct "Manage Inventory" links for admins across all TCG categories.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The "Open Import Tool" links will be removed from the public store views. Instead, if an admin is logged in, they will see a "Manage Inventory" button that takes them directly to the corresponding administrative panel (e.g., `Admin/lorcana_inventory`).

## Proposed Changes

We will modify the "No stock available" and "Welcome" sections of the store index and set views for all four categories.

### 1. Lorcana Views
#### [MODIFY] [lorcana_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/lorcana_index.php)
- Replace `Lorcana_Import` link with `Admin/lorcana_inventory`.
- Update text from "Open Import Tool" to "Manage Lorcana Inventory".

#### [MODIFY] [view_lorcana_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_set.php)
- Add the admin check in the `else` (no stock) block to provide a "Manage Inventory" link.

### 2. Magic (MTG) Views
#### [MODIFY] [magic_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/magic_index.php)
- Add the admin check to provide a "Manage Magic Inventory" link when the registry is empty.

#### [MODIFY] [view_mtg_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_mtg_set.php)
- Add the admin link in the "No stock available" block.

### 3. Pokémon Views
#### [MODIFY] [index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/index.php)
- Add the admin link for Pokémon inventory management.

#### [MODIFY] [view_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_set.php)
- Add the admin link in the "No stock available" block.

### 4. One Piece Views
#### [MODIFY] [onepiece_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/onepiece_index.php)
- Add the admin check to provide a "Manage One Piece Inventory" link.

#### [MODIFY] [view_onepiece_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_onepiece_set.php)
- Add the admin link in the "No stock available" block.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Log in as an **Admin**.
- Navigate to a set page with no stock (e.g., a brand new Lorcana set).
- Verify the "Open Import Tool" text is gone and replaced by "Manage Inventory".
- Click the link and verify it opens the correct Admin panel.
- Log out and verify the link is hidden from public customers.
